  "solution": "The pattern follow here is:\n\n10, 18, 38, 74, 150, ?\n\n2 × 10 - 2 = 18\n\n2 × 18 + 2 = 38\n\n2 × 38 - 2 = 74\n\n2 × 74 + 2 = 150\n\n**2 × 150 - 2 = 298**\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"Option 2\".**",
